<title>TURKEY: Malta-flagged ship refloated in Bosphorus.</title>
<headline>Malta-flagged ship refloated in Bosphorus.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Maltese-flag freighter Friendly has been refloated in the Bosphorus, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 26,646 dwt vessel, which ran aground on December 12 carrying 25,000 tonnes of steel from Odessa port in Ukraine to Alexandria in Egypt, was waiting anchored off Kumkapi for the completion of necessary formalities.</p>
